{
  "id": "rcft",
  "term": "RCFT",
  "definition": "RCFT is a cognitive test with two parts: copying a complex geometric figure and then drawing it again from memory after a delay. It is used to assess visuo-constructional ability, executive function, and delayed visual memory by judging how accurately and how well organized the reproduced figure is.",
